{
  "full_translation_en": "House of Representatives, 2082\nFirst Session\nMeeting Number - 4\nParliamentary\nNepal\nNotice - 2\n(Brief details of the meeting proceedings)\nTuesday, Chaitra 24, 2082\nThe meeting of the House of Representatives today commenced at 1:20 PM under the chairmanship of the Right Honourable Speaker Dol Prasad Aryal.\nFirst, in the Zero Hour, which commenced today, the following Honourable Members expressed their views on contemporary issues:-\nHon. Achyut Lamicchhane\nHon. Kusum Maharjan\nHon. Anushka Shrestha\nHon. Kruparam Rana\nHon. Krishna Hari Budhathoki\nHon. Afsana Banu\nHon. Komal Jawali\nHon. Abhishek Pratap Shah\nHon. Amrita B.K.\nHon. Krantishikha Dhital\nHon. Khagendra Karna\nHon. Arvind Sah\nHon. Arjun Kumar Karki\nHon. Khagendra Sunar\nHon. Ashok Kumar Chaudhary\nHon. Khadak Bahadur Buda\nHon. Aakriti Awasthi\nHon. Khadga Shahi\nHon. Khima BK.\nHon. Aaren Rai\nHon. Khushbu Oli\nHon. Ashish Gajurel\nHon. Gajala Shamim Mikrani\nHon. Ashika Tamang\nHon. Ganesh Karki\nHon. Indira Rana Magar\nHon. Eliza Gurung\nHon. Ganesh Dhimal\nHon. Eshuda Kumari Baral\nHon. Ganesh Parajuli\nHon. Ain Bahadur Mahar\nHon. Ganesh Bahadur Bishwakarma\nHon. Ojashwi Sherchan\nHon. Ganesh Singh Thagutra\nHon. Ankita Thakur\nHon. Gita Gurung\nHon. Kamal Subedi\nHon. Guru Prasad Baral\nHon. Govinda Panthi\nHon. Karishma Kathariya\nHon. Kavinra Burlakoti\nHon. Ganga Chhantyal\nHon. Kamini Kumari\nHon. Gangadevi Shrestha\nHon. Kal Bahadur Sahakari\nHon. Gangalakshmi Awal\nHon. Chandan Kumar Singh\nHon. Kul Bhakta Shakya\nThereafter, the Right Honourable Speaker informed about the correction made to the House of Representatives Business Advisory Committee, formed as per Rule 13 of the House of Representatives Regulations, 2079, with Honourable Ninu Kumari Karna being included instead of the previously mentioned name.\nSubsequently, the Secretary of the House of Representatives, Hakraj Rai, tabled the bills received from the National Assembly: \"Forensic Science Laboratory (Establishment and Operation) Bill, 2081\", \"Tourism Bill, 2081\", and \"Film Bill, 2081\", along with the messages from the National Assembly.\nThereafter, the next meeting of the House of Representatives was adjourned at 2:20 PM, scheduled to convene on Wednesday, Chaitra 24, 2082, at 1:00 PM.\nPadma Prasad Pandey\nSecretary-General\nPage 1/9",
